### Configuração da URL base
@baseURL = http://localhost:40000
@token = seu_token_aqui

### ==================================================
### TESTES CRUD - CARGOS
### ==================================================

### 1. GET ALL - Listar todos os cargos
GET {{baseURL}}/getAllCargos HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. GET BY ID - Buscar cargo por ID
POST {{baseURL}}/getCargoByID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cargoid": 1
}

### 3. INSERT - Inserir novo cargo
POST {{baseURL}}/insertCargo HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "codigo": "DEV-001",
    "descricao": "Desenvolvedor Júnior",
    "salario_base": 3500.00,
    "ativo": true
}

### 4. INSERT - Outro exemplo
POST {{baseURL}}/insertCargo HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

